{
  "page": 522,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4706,
      "text": "Dia (Ibrahim) berkata, \"Apakah urusanmu yang penting wahai para utusan?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4707,
      "text": "Mereka menjawab, \"Sesungguhnya kami diutus kepada kaum yang berdosa (kaum Luṭ),",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4708,
      "text": "agar kami menimpa mereka dengan batu-batu dari tanah (yang keras),",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4709,
      "text": "yang ditandai dari Tuhanmu untuk (membinasakan) orang-orang yang melampaui batas.\"813)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4710,
      "text": "Lalu Kami keluarkan orang-orang yang beriman yang berada di dalamnya (negeri kaum Luṭ).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4711,
      "text": "Maka Kami tidak mendapati di dalamnya (negeri itu), kecuali satu rumah dari orang-orang muslim (Luṭ).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4712,
      "text": "Dan Kami tinggalkan padanya (negeri itu) suatu tanda814) bagi orang-orang yang takut kepada azab yang pedih.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4713,
      "text": "Dan pada Musa (terdapat tanda-tanda kekuasaan Allah) ketika Kami mengutusnya kepada Fir'aun dengan membawa mukjizat yang nyata.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4714,
      "text": "Tetapi dia (Fir'aun) bersama bala tentaranya berpaling dan berkata, \"Dia adalah seorang penyihir atau orang gila.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4715,
      "text": "Maka Kami siksa dia beserta bala tentaranya, lalu Kami lemparkan mereka ke dalam laut, dalam keadaan tercela.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4716,
      "text": "Dan (juga) pada (kisah kaum) 'Ād, ketika Kami kirimkan kepada mereka angin yang membinasakan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4717,
      "text": "(angin itu) tidak membiarkan suatu apa pun yang dilandanya, bahkan dijadikannya seperti serbuk.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4718,
      "text": "Dan pada (kisah kaum) Samud, ketika dikatakan kepada mereka, \"Bersenang-senanglah kamu sampai waktu yang ditentukan.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4719,
      "text": "Lalu mereka berlaku angkuh terhadap perintah Tuhannya, maka mereka disambar petir sedang mereka melihatnya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4720,
      "text": "Maka mereka tidak mampu bangun dan juga tidak mendapat pertolongan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4721,
      "text": "Dan sebelum itu (telah Kami binasakan) kaum Nuh. Sungguh, mereka adalah kaum yang fasik.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4722,
      "text": "Dan langit Kami bangun dengan kekuasaan (Kami), dan Kami benar-benar meluaskannya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4723,
      "text": "Dan bumi telah Kami hamparkan; maka (Kami) sebaik-baik yang menghamparkan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4724,
      "text": "Dan segala sesuatu Kami ciptakan berpasang-pasangan agar kamu mengingat (kebesaran Allah).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4725,
      "text": "Maka segeralah kembali kepada (menaati) Allah. Sungguh, aku seorang pemberi peringatan yang jelas dari Allah untukmu.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4726,
      "text": "Dan janganlah kamu mengadakan tuhan yang lain selain Allah. Sungguh, aku seorang pemberi peringatan yang jelas dari Allah untukmu.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 522,
      "ruku": 457,
      "hizbQuarter": 209,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
  "language": "id"
}
